            "action_name": {
              "value": "Invoke Reckoning"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, enchantment, mental)\n\nTrigger: The skeletal Hellknight hits a foe with a Strike.\n\nThe skeletal Hellknight causes the creature struck to endure the pain of an Order of the Nail's reckoning\u2014a rite of mortification Hellknights of that order use to focus their minds. The creature struck feels as if nails are being driven into their body, and must succeed at a 17 Will save or be stunned 1 from the pain. On a critical failure, the pain manifests as actual puncture wounds, dealing an additional 2d6 points of piercing damage to the victim."
            },
